      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "so just hashing is not enough , so we use \"salt\"\n\nsalt for every users are unique always \nso add the salt to every password before hashing it \n\no we will use bcrypt : its crypto hashing  algo for securly hasing the password  , it has salt in built ",
