      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "to hash a password :\ntechnique 1 generate hash and salt on seperate function call \n\nbcrypt.gensalt(salrround,  function (err, salt){\n                        bcrypt.hash(myplantextpassword, salt, function (err, hash){\n\n                  // store hash in ur password DB\n                  });\n});\n\ntechnique 2:\nbcrypt.hash(myplanttextpassword, saltRound, function (err, hash){\n // store this hash in yur password db \n});\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "to hash a password :\ntechnique 1 generate hash and salt on seperate function call \n\nbcrypt.gensalt(salrround,  function (err, salt){\n                        bcrypt.hash(myplantextpassword, salt, function (err, hash){\n\n                  // store hash in ur password DB\n                  });\n});\n\ntechnique 2:\nbcrypt.hash(myplanttextpassword, saltRound, function (err, hash){\n // store this hash in yur password db \n});\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
